// Execution-level workflow history for the last 24 hours, plus any failed steps.
SailPointISC_WorkflowHistory
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| where IsExecutionEvent or IsFailure
| project TimeGenerated, FlowName, HistType, Outcome, Owner, WorkflowExecutionId, RequestId, IsFailure
| order by TimeGenerated desc
| take 200
